// Title: Uncommon Outbound Kerberos Connection
// Rule ID: e54979bd-c5f9-4d6c-967b-a04b19ac4c74
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.credential-access, attack.t1558, attack.lateral-movement, attack.t1550.003
// Category: network_connection
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
